    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located mid-way between Letterkenny and the Twin Towns of Ballybofey/Stranorlar (both 8kms) is this very conveniently situated modern home. Drumkeen's highly regarded National School, Church and Rosie's Bar/Restaurant are on your doorstep with both Towns and all their amenities within a ten minute drive. Built in 2009, this house comes to the market with the benefit of a first class defective block/mica report. Internal accommodation comprises of a sitting room with open fire with back boiler, kitchen/dining room with patio doors leading to a private rear lawn, utility and wc all on the ground floor. Three bedrooms (one en-suite) plus family bathroom are situated on the first floor. South west facing, the house overlooks a large green area. Car parking and lawn area to the front with an enclosed lawn at the rear. PV panels on the roof fitted after the BER report was undertaken adds to to its high energy efficiency. Houses in this development are always in demand and early viewing is recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Three bedroom semi-detached house<br><br>\nEntrance Hallway - 5.8m x 2.5m <br>Tiled floor.\nReturn style stairs to first floor.\nCloak cupboard under stairs.\nContains WC & WHB - with window.<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 5.2m x 3.8m <br>Open fire with back boiler.\nOak floor.\nLarge front window.\n3 stem centre ceiling light.<br><br><br>\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.6m x 3.6m <br>High and low levelkitchen units (ivory colour).\nStainless steel sink\nElectric oven - included\nElectric hob - included\nFridge-freezer - included\nDishwasher - included.\nDouble glass panel doors leading into Sitting Room.\nPatio doors to side.\nWindow overlooking rear garden.\n<br><br><br>\nUtility Room - 2.2m x 1.7m <br>Low level kitchen units.\nPlumbed for washing machine & tumble dryer - not included.\nTiled floor.\nPVC framed back door with glass panel.<br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4.0m x 3.3m <br>Front facing window.\nLaminated timber floor.\n<br><br><br>\nEn-suite - 2.6m x 1.6m <br>WHB, WC and large tray electric shower.\nFloor tiled.\nShower unit tiled.\nWindow\nVanity unit & electric light over WHB.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.8m x 3.0m <br>Window overlooking back garden.\nFloor carpeted.<br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 3.0m x 2.5m <br>Front facing window.\nLaminate timber floor.<br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2.5m x 2.2m <br>Bath, WC & WHB.\nVanity unit with electric light over WHB.\nFloor tiled.\nWindow.<br><br>"
      },
      {
